  "speaker_notes": [
    "Each pilot engagement supplies one research task. Twenty paired tasks correspond to twenty engagements.",
    "The practice lead and CFO release scale funding only after the evidence gates are reviewed. Critical data exceptions stop expansion."
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Keep each workstream bold and its owner regular within the same editable cell. Week headers and body cells use left alignment.",
    "The four gate icons form three directed transitions. The source arrow continuing after G4 is omitted because the plan has no fifth gate.",
    "The G4 description wraps before decide to remain clear of the dependency divider.",
    "The semantic map owns current geometry and type roles. The inherited frame is added outside the generated content region. Canonical SVGs replace generated icon stand-ins."
  ],
